<title>MALTA: Prime minister concedes defeat in Malta election.</title>
<headline>Prime minister concedes defeat in Malta election.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nationalist Party leader Edward Fenech Adami on Monday accepted the defeat of his government in Malta's general election, a party spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;Dr Fenech Adami informed the president of Malta early this morning that he accepted the victory of the Labour Party,&quot; the spokesman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
